=== Test 9: SELECT no FROM with grouped CTE qualifier — must reject ===
This query has no aggregate expression, so it is not an aggregate query.
Currently, RonSQL only supports aggregate queries and projection-only
SELECTs over supported CTE shapes (Phase E.3/I.8/I.11/I.12).  See
ronsql_join_phase7.md for the
broader non-aggregate roadmap.
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: Not an aggregate query.
